msgstr "Название тега"

#: /app/templates/index.php:5001
msgid "e.g., Business, Vacation, Groceries"
msgstr "например, Бизнес, Отпуск, Продукты"

#: /app/templates/index.php:5004 /app/templates/index.php:5189
#: /app/templates/index.php:6761 /app/templates/index.php:6850
#: /app/templates/index.php:6882
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Цвет"

#: /app/templates/index.php:5015 /app/templates/index.php:6890
msgid ""
"Stop offering this tag when tagging new transactions. Transactions that "
"already have it keep it."
msgstr ""
"Не предлагать этот тег при добавлении тегов к новым транзакциям. У "
